42	// CUDA-only build — the gfx942 .hip TUs are never compiled by nvcc). Gate each
43	// case by its backend macro, mirroring dispatch.cpp's WITH_CUDA/WITH_HIP split,
44	// so the Python front-end binds exactly the backend that was compiled in.
